  "changedFiles": [
    {
      "path": "docs/runbooks/storage.md",
      "status": "modified",
      "additions": 13,
      "deletions": 0,
      "patch": "@@ -16,3 +16,16 @@ Blobs under `exports/` move to the cool tier after 30 days and are deleted after\n \n Access is through Entra ID only; shared keys are disabled. Request the\n `Storage Blob Data Reader` role through the access portal for read access.\n+\n+## Diagnostics\n+\n+Read, write and delete logs for the prod blob service go to the shared\n+`log-platform-prod` Log Analytics workspace (table `StorageBlobLogs`). Failed\n+requests from the last day:\n+\n+```kusto\n+StorageBlobLogs\n+| where TimeGenerated > ago(1d)\n+| where AccountName == \"stexorgplatformprod\" and StatusCode >= 400\n+| summarize count() by OperationName, StatusText, CallerIpAddress\n+```",
      "previousPath": null
    },
    {
      "path": "envs/prod/storage.tf",
      "status": "modified",
      "additions": 20,
      "deletions": 0,
      "patch": "@@ -22,3 +22,23 @@ resource \"azurerm_storage_management_policy\" \"exports\" {\n     }\n   }\n }\n+\n+resource \"azurerm_monitor_diagnostic_setting\" \"storage_blob\" {\n+  name                       = \"diag-blob-to-law\"\n+  target_resource_id         = \"${module.storage.id}/blobServices/default\"\n+  log_analytics_workspace_id = var.log_analytics_workspace_id\n+\n+  enabled_log {\n+    category = \"StorageRead\"\n+  }\n+  enabled_log {\n+    category = \"StorageWrite\"\n+  }\n+  enabled_log {\n+    category = \"StorageDelete\"\n+  }\n+\n+  enabled_metric {\n+    category = \"Transaction\"\n+  }\n+}",
      "previousPath": null
    },
    {
      "path": "envs/prod/terraform.tfvars",
      "status": "modified",
      "additions": 2,
      "deletions": 0,
      "patch": "@@ -13,3 +13,5 @@ user_node_pools = {\n     node_taints = [\"workload=batch:NoSchedule\"]\n   }\n }\n+\n+log_analytics_workspace_id = \"/subscriptions/9a2d6e10-3c5f-4b8e-b7a1-e4c0f2d9a853/resourceGroups/rg-observability-prod/providers/Microsoft.OperationalInsights/workspaces/log-platform-prod\"",
      "previousPath": null
    },
    {
      "path": "envs/prod/variables.tf",
      "status": "modified",
      "additions": 5,
      "deletions": 0,
      "patch": "@@ -12,3 +12,8 @@ variable \"user_node_pools\" {\n   }))\n   default = {}\n }\n+\n+variable \"log_analytics_workspace_id\" {\n+  type        = string\n+  description = \"Resource ID of the shared Log Analytics workspace that receives diagnostics.\"\n+}",
      "previousPath": null
    }
